{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ax4zyt4z","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":58,"top":210,"width":1150,"height":76},"name":"Conclusiones detalle","text":"El estudio sugiere que LightVA facilita la exploración y reduce parte del trabajo manual.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#342331","alignment":"left"}}
